OL,4,BSutton's predictions v Kings of Leon   
OL,5,Bdrummer Nathan Followill               
OL,6,GArsenal co-chairman Josh Kroenke       
OL,7,Gshould probably turn his phone off if  
OL,8,Gthe Gunners fall behind against        
OL,9,GManchester City on Sunday.             
OL,11,FChris Sutton's predictions guest this  
OL,12,Fweek, Kings of Leon drummer and City   
OL,13,Ffan Nathan Followill, is good friends  
OL,14,Fwith Kroenke - and says he will be in  
OL,15,Ftouch if the game is going City's way. 
OL,17,F"I'm super excited for this weekend    
OL,18,Fand I've got my smack talk ready for   
OL,19,FJosh already," Followill told BBC      
